    "job_description": "We are looking for a highly skilled GenAI Engineer with expertise in LLM applications on Azure to join our team at Luxoft India LLP. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in artificial intelligence and machine learning, with experience working on large-scale projects.\nRoles and Responsibility\nDesign, develop, and deploy AI and ML models using Azure services such as Azure Machine Learning Service (AMS) and Azure Cognitive Services.\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams to identify business problems and develop solutions using AI and ML techniques.\nDevelop and maintain large-scale data pipelines and architectures to support AI and ML model development.\nWork closely with data engineers to design and implement data ingestion and processing pipelines.\nParticipate in code reviews and ensure high-quality code standards.\nStay up-to-date with industry trends and emerging technologies in AI and ML.\nJob Requirements\nStrong understanding of AI and ML concepts, including supervised and unsupervised learning methods.\nExperience with deep learning frameworks such as TensorFlow or PyTorch.\nProficiency in programming languages such as Python, C++, or Java.\nExcellent problem-solving skills and ability to analyze complex data sets.\nStrong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with technical and non-technical stakeholders.\nAbility to manage multiple projects simultaneously and meet deadlines.\n\nLocation - Pune,Mumbai,Chennai,Banagalore",
